# LinkedIn — persistent Chrome profiles per account.  Each subdir is a full
# Chromium user-data-dir (cookies, cache, localStorage, fingerprint state)
# bound to one LinkedInAccount UUID.  NEVER commit: it contains the user's
# active li_at cookie + browser state.  Path mirrors LINKEDIN_PROFILES_DIR.
backend/_linkedin_profiles/
